From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since33 complete 0x1b waiter, immediate 0x42

since32 drained 8x 0x1b after remaining=0, then sent 0x42 on gpio=0.
Stock zeroflash_do_romboot_firmware_download after write_message(0x45)==0
is immediately switch_mode(FW_MODE_BOOTLOADER) ->
syna_tcm_run_bootloader_firmware -> CMD_ROMBOOT_RUN_BOOTLOADER_FIRMWARE
0x42. No drain, no identify after 0x42 from RomBoot, not 0x14.

since24 skip-0x30 on REPORT_STATUS swallowed 0x1b without waking
write_message. This IC uses 0x1b as the command response for 0x45/0x42.
Complete any in-flight waiter, still skip DOWNLOAD_CONFIG 0x30.

since33:
- No 8-frame drain-until-idle before 0x42.
- 0x1b completes pending write_message. Log once:
  0x1b complete waiter cmd=0x%02x
- gpio=0 at 0x42: disable_irq, send, enable_irq (level IRQ).
- After 0x42: log retval, mode, gpio, irq_en. 0x01/0x02 -> identify +
  touch_init. Still 0x04 -> skip retry, skip touch_init.
- Keep: no ENABLE_REPORT 0x05, no do_polling, no lcd_rst, no retry 97k.

Applies after syna-tcm-romboot-stock-post-0x45.patch.

